{
  "title": { "zh": "等够 11 拍" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "探针刚插上时不知道总线正说到哪里，要先等一阵。等多久是一个定好的数，板上还没有能写下一个数的元件。"
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "新元件<part-ref to=\"part:const\"></part-ref>：总是给出它设的那个数。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "adds": ["const"],
  "after": { "zh": "计数加上一个比较，就是\"等到第几拍\"。" },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "1-5",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "从第 11 拍（从 0 数起）开始一直回答「是」，在那之前回答「否」。"
      },
      "outputs": [{ "name": "ready", "label": { "zh": "够了" } }],
      "tests": [{ "bus": { "idle": 16, "frames": [], "tail": 0 } }, { "bus": { "idle": 24, "frames": [], "tail": 0 } }],
      "want": { "ready": { "since": { "tick": 11 } } },
      "solution": [
        "r = reg[reg=A, start=0]()",
        "i = arith[form=inc](r)",
        "k = keep[reg=A](i)",
        "ten = const[value=10]()",
        "lt = compare[form=lt](ten, r)",
        "ready <- lt"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "r = reg[reg=A, start=0]()",
        "i = arith[form=inc](r)",
        "k = keep[reg=A](i)",
        "e = const[value=11]()",
        "q = compare[form=eq](r, e)",
        "ready <- q"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
